Network Services

This section documents the network configuration and services used in the Active Directory lab.

Configuration

- Configured DC01 with a static IPv4 address.
- Configured DNS for domain name resolution.
- Configured DHCP to assign IP addresses to client devices.
- Connected DC01 and PC01 through the VirtualBox Internal Network.
- Configured PC01 to use DC01 as its DNS server.

Network Details

- Network: 192.168.50.0/24
- DC01: 192.168.50.10
- DNS Server: 192.168.50.10
- Subnet Mask: 255.255.255.0

